---@field auto_pause_exempt? boolean Exempt this scout from the inactivity pause, which otherwise switches off a scout that goes a fortnight without surfacing anything anyone engages with. Set it on watchdog scouts whose value is staying quiet. Defaults to false.
---@field run_cron_schedule? string|distilled.Null Optional five-field cron expression, e.g. '30 9 * * *' (daily at 09:30), '0 9,17 * * *' (twice daily), or '0 9 * * 1-5' (weekday mornings). Evaluated in the project timezone. Takes precedence over `run_interval_minutes`; occurrences must be at least 30 minutes apart.

