---@class posthog.vision.UpdateVisionAlertRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this vision alert configuration.
---@field scanner_id string Scanner whose observations this alert watches. Immutable after creation.
---@field name? string Human-readable name for this alert. Defaults to 'Untitled alert' on create when omitted.
---@field enabled? boolean Whether the alert is active. Disabling a metric alert resets its state to not_firing.
---@field kind posthog.vision.VisionAlertKindEnum|string 'metric' fires when a metric crosses a threshold over a rolling window; 'match' fires on every observation that matches the selection. Immutable after creation. * `metric` - Metric * `match` - Match
---@field selection? posthog.vision.VisionAlertSelection Which observations count. Empty matches every observation of the scanner.
---@field metric? posthog.vision.VisionAlertMetricEnum|string Metric alerts only: what to measure over the window. 'avg_score' requires a scorer scanner. * `count` - Count matching observations * `avg_score` - Average score
---@field direction? posthog.vision.VisionAlertDirectionEnum|string Metric alerts only: whether the alert fires at or above, or at or below, the threshold. * `above` - At or above * `below` - At or below
---@field threshold? number|distilled.Null Metric alerts only: the threshold value. Required for metric alerts, must be omitted for match alerts.
---@field window_days? number Metric alerts only: rolling window in days. Allowed values: [1, 3, 7, 14, 30].
---@field check_interval_minutes? number Metric alerts only: evaluation cadence in minutes, at least 15.
---@field evaluation_periods? number Metric alerts only: total check periods in the sliding evaluation window (M in N-of-M).
---@field datapoints_to_alarm? number Metric alerts only: how many periods must breach to fire (N in N-of-M).
---@field cooldown_minutes? number Metric alerts only: minimum minutes between repeated notifications. 0 means no cooldown.
---@field schedule_restriction? posthog.vision.AlertScheduleRestriction|distilled.Null Blocked local time windows when the alert must not notify. Times use the project timezone. Null disables quiet hours.
---@field snooze_until? string|distilled.Null ISO 8601 timestamp until which the alert is snoozed. Set to null to unsnooze.

